# The production chains on the basic content set, with no install: bread from the mill and the baker, grain from the farm to the mill, meat
# from the pig farm and the butcher, and fish from the fisher, each reaching the castle. It needs no install and no SIEDLER_DIR. Run it with
# seed 4455544685788642 and size 1 (picked with `mise run seed-info -- --content-set basic --seed 4455544685788642`):
#   sh tools/play-run.sh basic-production --game-view --content-set basic --seed 4455544685788642 --size 1 --fps 10
# On that map the castle's click places it at 15,5 (flag 16,6). Its start stock holds 16 planks, 11 stones, 3 grain, 1 flour, 1 pig, 2 meat,
# 2 bread, and 2 fish; a lake lies east of 18,5. Sites at 18,5 (small), 18,9 and 20,12 (large) have their flags at 19,6, 19,10, and 21,13.
#
# What it proves and what it cannot. The castle holds 20 first settlers, 5 of them without a job (CastleRoster), and every worker without a
# tool and every road's carrier takes one. A game's first site also turns one of the five into a settler of another job (a settler of job 3
# joins the castle's idle ones, seen in the lists), so four are left for workers and carriers; a second large site built at once takes one more.
# Farm, mill, and baker with their three roads need more than that, so the script plays four fresh games on the one seed, each started by `seed`
# to another seed and back:
#   1. mill and baker: the castle's grain goes over the road to the mill, its flour on to the baker, and bread back (bread 2 -> 6, grain and
#      flour used up);
#   2. farm and mill: the farm's grain reaches the mill, and the flour piles up past the 4 the start stock could give (flour 1 -> 6);
#   3. butcher, then pig farm (built in turn: both sites at once leave the butcher without a settler): the pig farm's pigs reach the butcher, and meat rises past the
#      3 the start stock could give;
#   4. fisher: his catch reaches the castle (fish 2 -> 5).
# So bread is proved in two games (farm to mill, mill to baker), never as one chain farm to baker. The rules are the basic set's stand-ins (ADR 0018).
expect seed = 4455544685788642
expect size = 1
wait 0.3
click-tile 15 5
wait 0.3
expect bread = 2
expect flour = 1
expect grain = 3
button Baker
click-tile 18 9
button Baker
button Mill
click-tile 20 12
button Mill
wait 0.3
expect-count building = 3
button Road
click-tile 16 6
click-tile 17 6
click-tile 18 6
click-tile 19 6
click-tile 19 7
click-tile 19 8
click-tile 19 9
click-tile 19 10
button Road
button Road
click-tile 19 10
click-tile 20 10
click-tile 21 11
click-tile 21 12
click-tile 21 13
button Road
wait 0.3
fast-forward until bread >= 6 max 200000
wait 0.3
expect bread = 6
expect flour = 0
expect grain = 0
shot bread 19 9 5 3
dump bread
list bread

# The next game: another seed and back starts a fresh game on this seed, with its 20 first settlers and its start stock again.
seed 1234567812345678
wait 0.3
seed 4455544685788642
wait 0.3
expect planks = 0
click-tile 15 5
wait 0.3
expect flour = 1
expect grain = 3
button Mill
click-tile 18 5
button Mill
button Farm
click-tile 18 9
button Farm
wait 0.3
expect-count building = 3
button Road
click-tile 16 6
click-tile 17 6
click-tile 18 6
click-tile 19 6
button Road
button Road
click-tile 19 6
click-tile 19 7
click-tile 19 8
click-tile 19 9
click-tile 19 10
button Road
wait 0.3
fast-forward until flour >= 6 max 300000
wait 0.3
expect flour >= 6
shot flour 19 8 5 3
dump flour
list flour

# The next game: another seed and back starts a fresh game on this seed, with its 20 first settlers and its start stock again.
seed 1234567812345678
wait 0.3
seed 4455544685788642
wait 0.3
expect planks = 0
click-tile 15 5
wait 0.3
expect meat = 2
expect pigs = 1
button Butcher
click-tile 18 9
button Butcher
wait 0.3
button Road
click-tile 16 6
click-tile 17 6
click-tile 18 6
click-tile 19 6
click-tile 19 7
click-tile 19 8
click-tile 19 9
click-tile 19 10
button Road
wait 0.3
fast-forward until ticks >= 8000 max 100000
wait 0.3
shot butcher-built 19 9 4 3
button Pig farm
wait 0.3
click-tile 20 12
wait 0.3
button Pig farm
wait 0.3
expect-count building = 3
button Road
wait 0.3
click-tile 19 10
wait 0.3
click-tile 20 10
click-tile 21 11
click-tile 21 12
click-tile 21 13
button Road
wait 0.3
fast-forward until meat >= 4 max 300000
wait 0.3
expect meat >= 4
shot meat 19 9 5 3
dump meat
list meat

# The next game: another seed and back starts a fresh game on this seed, with its 20 first settlers and its start stock again.
seed 1234567812345678
wait 0.3
seed 4455544685788642
wait 0.3
expect planks = 0
click-tile 15 5
wait 0.3
expect fish = 2
button Fisher
click-tile 18 5
button Fisher
wait 0.3
button Road
click-tile 16 6
click-tile 17 6
click-tile 18 6
click-tile 19 6
button Road
wait 0.3
fast-forward until fish >= 5 max 200000
wait 0.3
expect fish >= 5
shot fish 19 6 4 3
dump fish
list fish
